  "title": "UltraText Bench: A Comprehensive Bilingual Benchmark for Evaluating Visual Text Rendering in Image Generation",
  "summary": "UltraText Bench introduces a bilingual benchmark for evaluating visual text rendering in image generation, with 432 prompts spanning 24 scene categories and three difficulty levels. It provides a structured approach to assess image quality and text fidelity, while testing how well image models can maintain visual quality when generating text across multiple regions with correct placement and legibility.",
